-#
  TRK-05, BR-20: for how many months car positions are kept. The map's own
  30 days are named, so that nobody takes them for the period.
- refusal = setting.errors[:position_months].first
%section.setting-card{ aria: { labelledby: "positions-kept-title" } }
  %h2#positions-kept-title How long car positions are kept
  = form_with url: settings_positions_path, method: :patch, class: "form" do |form|
    .field
      = form.label :position_months, "Keep positions for"
      - if refusal
        %span.field-error#position-months-error= refusal
      .field-unit
        = form.number_field :position_months, value: setting.position_months_before_type_cast,
          min: Setting::MONTHS.min, required: true, class: "short",
          aria: { describedby: [ "position-months-hint", ("position-months-error" if refusal) ].compact.join(" "),
                  invalid: ("true" if refusal) }
        %span months
      %span.hint#position-months-hint
        Not less than #{Setting::MONTHS.min} months. Every night at 03:30 the positions older than this are deleted.
    %div
      = form.submit "Save", class: "button"
  %p.note.kept-now
    - if oldest
      Kept now: positions since #{tag.strong(l(oldest))}.
    - else
      No position is kept yet.
  %p.note
    The main map shows a car at its last position of the last #{CarPosition::SHOWN.in_days.to_i} days; older positions
    stay kept and are not shown.
